  "body": "Last opportunity to secure this beautiful home before Christmas, massive sea views and two homes in one.\r\n\r\nPositioned on a generous 523m² (more or less) freehold site, this 293m² (approx. incl porch and covered balcony) exceptional family home in Orewa delivers the perfect balance of luxury, modern family living, and breathtaking sea views.\r\n \r\nThis home situated in one of the most peaceful, quiet and desirable streets of Orewa - Pacific Heights Road.\r\n \r\nDesigned for multi-generation living and granny potential, this property features five double bedrooms, three bathrooms, two versatile living areas and a double garage.\r\n \r\nDownstairs features a double garage, two double bedrooms, a kitchenette, a sitting lounge, plus a full bathroom. With its very own separate entrance, it offers great privacy away from the main house and it also provides excellent granny rental potential or Airbnb income.\r\n \r\nUpstairs comprises three well sized double bedrooms, including a spacious master bedroom with ensuite (build in rainfall shower), two double bedrooms, a family bathroom, a modern kitchen, a lounge/dining, a separate laundry and a covered balcony. You can enjoy impressive sea view from the kitchen, lounge/dining and the balcony. The master bedroom also flows out to a spacious kwila deck, ideal for spa, BBQ, outdoor living and entertaining while enjoying the sea view.\r\n \r\nThis home is finished with quality finishes throughout, a modern kitchen with European brand appliances, additional insulation between floorboards, fully tiled in all bathrooms; and 2.7m stud height upstairs.\r\n \r\nAdditional premium features:\r\n* Central air conditioning\r\n* Additional air condition unit for downstairs' lounge\r\n* Intercom\r\n* CCTV security system\r\n* Bluetooth sound system both in the main lounge and master bedroom\r\n* Double built in ovens\r\n* Double built in bathtubs\r\n* Separate laundry\r\n* Landscaped easy care garden\r\n* Remainder of 10 years master build warranty\r\n \r\nVendor is relocating and committed to sell. Contact Tim today on 021 055 2650 to arrange your very own private viewing.",
